<title>GERMANY: German Nov wholesale prices down 0.6 pct mo/mo.</title>
<headline>German Nov wholesale prices down 0.6 pct mo/mo.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic data:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE PRICES	Nov 96	Oct 96	 Nov 95</p>
<p> Monthly change		    -0.6	   +0.2	   -0.1</p>
<p> Yearly change		     +0.4	   +0.9	   -0.4</p>
<p> Index (basis 1991)	     102.4	  103.0	   102.0</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, +49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
